type: software
title: statespacecheck
abstract: >-
  Goodness-of-fit diagnostics for state space models: time-resolved and
  per-event measures of consistency between the predictive state
  distribution and the likelihood of each observation, for identifying when
  and where a model fails to agree with the data.
